      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Minor Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>A long, prehensile tentacle or elephantine snout (1d10: 1-8 Tentacle; 9-10 Snout) grows out o your body (tentacle) or head (snout). The feeler functions as an arm and can hold things and has a very sensitive touch. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.4xF7M6ylIiGntekh]{Tentacles} (SB+3) Creature Trait and @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.9h82z72XGo9tfgQS]{Acute Sense} (Touch). If you have a snout you can drink water and breathe through it as well.</p>"
